OL,3,GNEWSAThousands flock to couple's
OL,4,AHalloween house
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of visitors have been
OL,7,Fflocking to a semi-detached house in
OL,8,Fthe West Midlands, which has been
OL,9,Ftransformed into a celebration of all
OL,10,Fthings Halloween.
OL,12,FThe home of Darren Mackenzie and Karen
OL,13,FPearce has been decked out with
OL,14,Fmonsters, skeletons and pumpkins taking
OL,15,Fover the driveway, garage and garden.
OL,17,FHundreds queued on Friday night to see
OL,18,Fthe attraction on Hob Moor Road,
OL,19,FYardley where the owners are raising
OL,20,Fmoney for a mental health charity.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
