OL,3,GNEWSAThousands flock to couple's
OL,4,AHalloween house
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's just crazy," said Karen, "we've
OL,7,Fhad over three thousand through the
OL,8,Fdoors and about five hundred in the
OL,9,Fqueue now".
